        "cooked": "<p>Sooooo I just noticed that GI Bunker now has a bio, how long has that been up without anyone commenting on it?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The bio makes me think of other, more policitial question relating to the multiverse. Who did kill Hitler in this corner of the multiverse? Was there a Stalin afterwards? How did Nixon get around super people with super hearing listening in on his missing 18 minutes?</p>",
