        "created_at": "2015-01-08T21:16:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Foote\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/48/1877_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Foote:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Not sure when that went up. It's curious why they choose to update the bios they do. Some promos have bios (like Rook City Wraith), and many don't. We get GI Bunker bio but not a Pappy Legacy bio (which you would think would go up at the same time since they came out together).</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I suspect it's because they were the ones that can be unlocked in the video game. I bet as more become unlockable, more bios will be updated.</p>",
